[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-IRS001
TITLE: Transmission content for a pattern exchange
STATEMENT: >>>
A transmission shall be able to carry the facility, the full call sign, the registration, an optional position, the phrase kind, the runway identifier, a sequence number, an ATIS letter, a frequency in megahertz, the next facility, the emergency nature, the intention, and whether a taxi clearance includes hold short. Wind and altimeter may arrive on an inbound clearance and shall not be copied into the readback. Acceptance is a landing clearance whose runway and kind survive parsing and whose readback contains neither wind nor altimeter.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The fields are the information content. The phrase is their spoken form.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Interface
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
